 "note": "Lunenburg High School Faculty/Staff Roster 2009-2010 printed at lines 18-20 (principal Michael Barney). Lines 1-17 are the end of the LHS narrative; line 60 is the page number. Two columns of bare names under department headings; the right column's Unified Arts (heading line 39), Guidance (heading on line 52 beside Stephanie Guerin) and the AD/Athletic Sec'y/Media Specialist block have no other heading. A name alone on a line where both columns' lists are still running cannot be placed in a column from the text, so grade_or_dept is left empty: Robert Hill (38), Nathan Diperri (46), Phil McMurray (55). 'Media Specialist' at line 49 labels Pamela Vallee on line 50. Line 52 holds Stephanie Guerin (left, Special Services) and the Guidance heading (right); line 54 the Tutors/Aides heading (left) and Katie Hebert (right). Karen Martin is also on the central office list (page 27). The roster continues on page 40."
